# The steps tests/extera.env's run takes (mac-host --script): seconds from the start, then the step.
# Logs in to a Telegram test-server account: country code 999 makes exteraGram switch to the test servers;
# a number 99966XYYYY there needs no SMS, its code is X five times. Coordinates are in the 1080x2400 frame.
