14.5 tap 540 2100
20 shot phone
20.5 tap 804 2130
21 tap 804 2130
21.5 tap 804 2130
22 shot code999
22.5 tap 600 1078
23 tap 804 1970
23.5 tap 804 1970
24 tap 456 1810
24.5 tap 108 2130
25 tap 804 1810
25.5 tap 804 2130
26 tap 108 1810
26.5 shot number
27 tap 936 1596
29.5 shot confirm
30 tap 894 1338
36 shot sent
36.5 type 22222
37 shot code
43 shot after-code
43.5 type Husk
44.5 shot name
45 enter
51 shot after-name
56 shot later
